    Bug 1991259 - Add enterprise policy to disable QR export. r=thunderbird-reviewers,babolivier,aleca

    These tests can be run to verify:
    - ../mach mochitest comm/mail/components/preferences/test/browser/browser_qrExportDisabled.js [NEW]
    - ../mach mochitest comm/mail/components/preferences/test/browser/browser_qrExport.js
    - ../mach xpcshell-test comm/mail/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_simple_pref_policies.js [UPDATED]
    Manual testing with app menu and menu bar and Settings tab:
    - Verify that with `mail.qrexport.enabled=true`, the "Export for Mobile" Settings category and both menu items are present and functional.
    - Verified that with `mail.qrexport.enabled=false`, the "Export for Mobile" Settings category and both menu items are hidden.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313130

